const brandFallbacks={'OCB':{accent:'#008A45',soft:'#DDF7E8'},'LP Bank':{accent:'#B77419',soft:'#FFF0D2'},'TPBank':{accent:'#673B91',soft:'#EFE2FF'},'HDBank':{accent:'#D31D3C',soft:'#FFE3EA'},'SaigonBank':{accent:'#006BA9',soft:'#DBF2FF'}};
function mediaForBank(b){return {...brandFallbacks[b.name],...(window.DBI_MEDIA?.[b.name]??{}),name:b.name,label:b.label};}
function bankMediaTabs(current){return '<div class="bank-media-tabs" aria-label="Khám phá hồ sơ ngân hàng">'+D.banks.map(b=>{const m=mediaForBank(b),active=b.name===current.name;return '<button class="bank-media-tab '+(active?'selected':'')+'" data-media-bank="'+esc(b.name)+'" aria-label="Xem hồ sơ '+esc(b.label)+'" aria-pressed="'+active+'" style="--brand:'+m.accent+';--brand-soft:'+m.soft+'">'+(m.logo?'<img src="'+esc(m.logo)+'" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="98" height="30">':'<b>'+esc(b.label)+'</b>')+'<span>'+esc(b.label)+' <i>↗</i></span></button>';}).join('')+'</div>';}
function bankVisual(b,compact=false){const m=mediaForBank(b),photo=m.images?.[0];return '<div class="bank-visual '+(compact?'compact':'')+'" data-tilt style="--brand:'+m.accent+';--brand-soft:'+m.soft+'"><div class="visual-orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="visual-orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="visual-photo-frame">'+(photo?'<img class="bank-photo" src="'+esc(photo.src)+'" alt="'+esc(photo.alt)+'" width="620" height="410" loading="'+(compact?'lazy':'eager')+'" decoding="async" data-photo-main>':'<div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">'+esc(b.label)+'</div>')+'<div class="photo-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="visual-caption">'+esc(b.label)+' · Hình ảnh minh họa</span></div><div class="visual-logo">'+(m.logo?'<img src="'+esc(m.logo)+'" alt="Logo '+esc(b.label)+'" width="124" height="43">':'<b>'+esc(b.label)+'</b>')+'</div><div class="visual-float visual-float-top"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><div><b>6 trụ cột</b><small>Hồ sơ năng lực số</small></div></div><div class="visual-float visual-float-bottom"><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span><div><b>140 tiêu chí</b><small>Bộ chỉ số nghiên cứu</small></div></div>'+(m.images?.length>1?'<div class="photo-switch" role="group" aria-label="Chọn ảnh '+esc(b.label)+'">'+m.images.map((p,i)=>'<button data-photo-src="'+esc(p.src)+'" data-photo-alt="'+esc(p.alt)+'" data-photo-source="'+esc(p.source)+'" aria-label="Ảnh '+(i+1)+' · '+esc(p.alt)+'" aria-pressed="'+(i===0)+'" class="'+(i===0?'active':'')+'"><span></span></button>').join('')+'</div>':'')+'</div>';}
function bankPhotoCredit(b){const m=mediaForBank(b);return m.images?.length?'<div class="photo-credit" data-photo-credit="'+esc(b.name)+'">Ảnh minh họa · <a href="'+esc(m.images[0].source)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">'+esc(b.label)+' ↗</a></div>':'';}
function selectedMediaBank(){return bank(S.bank==='all'?S.focus:S.bank)??ranked()[0];}
function bindBankVisuals(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-media-bank]').forEach(el=>el.onclick=()=>{S.bank=el.dataset.mediaBank;S.focus=S.bank;render();});document.querySelectorAll('[data-photo-src]').forEach(el=>el.onclick=()=>{const visual=el.closest('.bank-visual'),photo=visual.querySelector('[data-photo-main]');if(!photo)return;photo.src=el.dataset.photoSrc;photo.alt=el.dataset.photoAlt;const credit=visual.parentElement.querySelector('[data-photo-credit] a');if(credit)credit.href=el.dataset.photoSource;visual.querySelectorAll('[data-photo-src]').forEach(button=>{const active=button===el;button.classList.toggle('active',active);button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));});photo.classList.remove('photo-change');if(window.DBI_EXPERIENCE)window.DBI_EXPERIENCE.photoEntrance(photo);else if(window.DBI_MOTION?.enabled())requestAnimationFrame(()=>photo.classList.add('photo-change'));});}
